  "expected_accessibility_effect": "Focus returns to the opener button after closing the dialog via Escape or close button, satisfying focus order requirements.",
  "functional_risks": [
    "If any external code relies on the focus trap listener being active during the focus restoration step, it may not receive expected events.",
    "Removing listeners before focus restoration could theoretically miss a key event that occurs exactly at the same time, but this is unlikely as the dialog is being hidden."
  ],
  "verification_requirements": [
    "Verify that pressing Escape when the dialog is open moves focus back to the opener button.",
